{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",

  "_README": [
    "SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the Volare / P50B 26S21P project.",
    "",
    "MATLAB, Python and the Mission Control browser engine all read this file.",
    "Change a number here and it changes everywhere. Do not hard-code physical",
    "parameters anywhere else.",
    "",
    "LEAF FORMAT",
    "  Every physical parameter is an object:",
    "    { \"v\": value, \"u\": unit, \"s\": source, \"n\": note }",
    "  v  value (number, string or boolean)",
    "  u  unit, SI unless stated",
    "  s  provenance tag, see provenance_tags below",
    "  n  optional note explaining the choice",
    "",
    "Keys starting with _ are documentation and are ignored by the readers.",
    "",
    "MEASURED CURVE DATA lives in params/cells/p50b.json (OCV, R0(SOC,T),",
    "entropic dU/dT, discharge curves, cycle life) because it is bulky and",
    "changes as a unit."
  ],

  "provenance_tags": {
    "MEASURED": "Measured in-house on this project's hardware. Highest confidence.",
    "DATASHEET": "Direct from a manufacturer datasheet held in 04_data/.",
    "DIGITISED": "Traced from a manufacturer datasheet plot. Real data, with tracing error.",
    "PUBLISHED_TEST": "Third-party published characterisation.",
    "CALCULATED": "Derived from other parameters in this file.",
    "DESIGN_CHOICE": "A value the team selected. Not a physical constant; free to change.",
    "ASSUMPTION": "Engineering estimate, defensible but unverified.",
    "PLACEHOLDER": "Invented to let the model run. NOT quotable. Must be replaced."
  },

